{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想為 iPhone 或 iPad 內的相片分門別類，又不想被廣告打擾？Easy Albums 是一款專為 iOS 而設的相片整理工具，建立相簿後只需把相片拖曳進去即可完成分類，更能找出重複或相似的影像。應用沒有廣告與內購，亦無需連接互聯網，程式體積僅約 3 MB，同時支援 iPhone 與 iPad。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>拖放分類與重複相片比對</h2>\n<p>建立相簿只需點按左上角「＋」按鈕並輸入名稱；在相簿上向左滑動可刪除，向右滑動則可改名。整理相片採用拖放方式，長按相片拖到目標相簿放手即可。點按右上角圖示可刪除相片或將其移出相簿，點按「旗幟」圖示則可搜尋相似或重複相片，三下點按縮圖放大比對。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-703-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-704-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-705-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-706-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-707-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-708-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Easy Albums</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T10:39:25.158752+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}